            <div xml:id="d871">

                <pb facs="0800" n="788" xml:id="pg788"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00111 A.R./1103: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Des
                            Portes</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1940-05-21T16:00:00-04:00">May 21, 1940—4
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>34. Your 43, May 20, 1 p.m. The Department has not been informed that similar
                    memoranda have been presented to the other American republics. Inquiries,
                    however, are being made. You may so advise the Foreign Minister.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
